<title>INDIA: India 96/97 gross tax revenue 1,323.2 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 gross tax revenue 1,323.2 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's 1996/97 (April-March) gross tax revenue, previously estimated at 1,321.5 billion rupees, has been revised to 1,323.2 billion rupees, Finance Minister P. Chidambaram said on Friday.</p>
